    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Institute for Global Health and Development (IGHD) at Aga Khan University, in collaboration with the Pakistan Academy of Sciences (PAS) and the Centre for Economic Research in Pakistan (CERP), organized the Collaborative Symposium on Climate Change and Health & Development Consequences in Pakistan: Challenges and Opportunities. Held at the Pakistan Academy of Sciences in Islamabad, the event brought together experts, policymakers, and stakeholders to discuss the growing impacts of climate change on Pakistan's health, agriculture, and economic stability.",
